  "question": "Can Zhao Wanli's 1951 original publication, previously bibliographically located to 《文物参考资料》1951年第9期 pp.221–233, now be bound to concrete physical holdings of the exact original issue rather than only to a later 2011 collected-text page?",
  "answer": "Yes for original-issue physical access routing; no for direct article-page collation. The National Library of China review carried forward from Batch 12HF locates Zhao Wanli's 《永乐大典展览的意义——一九五一年八月北京图书馆举办》 in 《文物参考资料》1951年第9期, pp.221–233. CiNii's serial record NCID AA11467834 establishes the 1951 numbering as volume 2, issues 1–12, so the target is volume 2 issue 9. Osaka Metropolitan University Libraries' own OPAC independently records its Sugimoto Library holdings as 1951(1–7, 9–12), which directly includes issue 9. CiNii additionally lists explicit issue-level holdings including Kyoto University Katsura 2(1,3,5–12), Doshisha University 2(2–12), Waseda University Toyama 1951(2–4,6–12), and Ehime University 2(6–12), each of which includes issue 9. These are lawful physical access routes only. The project has not directly reviewed pp.221–233 or the Ding Huikang passage in the original 1951 issue, has not submitted any copy/ILL request, and has not transmitted identity or payment information.",
